WEBVTT

00:00:00.540 --> 00:00:01.070
Hello!

00:00:01.176 --> 00:00:05.378
At the end of the day, do you know exactly how much each staff member took,

00:00:05.328 --> 00:00:06.430
in cash or by card?

00:00:06.744 --> 00:00:10.070
With VaraaAi, staff report right after each customer,

00:00:10.020 --> 00:00:12.110
and you simply check and approve.

00:00:12.793 --> 00:00:14.701
When they've finished with a customer,

00:00:14.651 --> 00:00:17.489
the staff member opens that booking on the Bookings page,

00:00:17.677 --> 00:00:19.089
and taps Report income.

00:00:19.725 --> 00:00:23.110
The report opens, with the amount due for this booking at the top.

00:00:23.470 --> 00:00:25.990
They enter what the customer paid in the right box:

00:00:26.088 --> 00:00:28.710
cash, bank card, or MobilePay.

00:00:29.137 --> 00:00:31.830
Tap Fill in to enter the full amount in one go.

00:00:32.273 --> 00:00:34.790
Paid online in advance, or by gift card?

00:00:35.219 --> 00:00:36.390
There's a box for that too.

00:00:37.026 --> 00:00:41.528
The line Total collected adds up by itself, and says Matches the amount due.

00:00:42.036 --> 00:00:44.808
If the customer left a tip, enter it under Tip.

00:00:45.157 --> 00:00:48.968
Tips belong to the staff member, and are not added to the salon's income.

00:00:49.397 --> 00:00:51.768
They can add a note, and a photo of the receipt.

00:00:52.113 --> 00:00:53.768
Then tap Send report.

00:00:54.325 --> 00:00:55.387
Now it's your turn.

00:00:55.656 --> 00:00:57.147
Tap Income management.

00:00:57.416 --> 00:01:02.107
At the top are the total collected, what's approved, what's waiting, and tips.

00:01:02.376 --> 00:01:03.947
Below is each report.

00:01:04.296 --> 00:01:06.907
Compare it with the amount due, and tap Approve.

00:01:07.256 --> 00:01:11.467
If the amount isn't right, tap Don't approve, so the staff member can fix it.

00:01:11.757 --> 00:01:14.347
To go faster, tap Approve all.

00:01:14.955 --> 00:01:17.550
Once approved, the amount moves to Approved.

00:01:18.027 --> 00:01:21.710
The section By staff member shows how much each person took in the period.

00:01:22.133 --> 00:01:24.590
It's also worth turning on Remind staff to report:

00:01:24.884 --> 00:01:28.239
when a booking ended more than twenty-four hours ago without a report,

00:01:28.189 --> 00:01:29.230
the app reminds them.

00:01:29.578 --> 00:01:30.910
Now take the quiz below.
